OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting and domestic abuse    
OL,4,Adrive up recorded crime                
OL,6,FThe number of crimes recorded by Police
OL,7,FScotland increased by 9% in the last   
OL,8,Fyear, with significant spikes in       
OL,9,Fshoplifting and domestic abuse.        
OL,11,FStatistics for the 12 months leading up
OL,12,Fto September revealed the force logged 
OL,13,F333,115 crimes - 16% more than in 2022.
OL,15,FA breakdown showed shoplifting soared  
OL,16,Fby 26% (61,107 crimes) while domestic  
OL,17,Fabuse increased by 21% (3,415 crimes). 
OL,19,FNon-sexual crimes of violence went up  
OL,20,Fby 8%, sexual crimes by 5% and crimes  
OL,21,Fof dishonesty by 16%.                  
